# Superseded historical drafts — preserved on disk, never tracked. Kept because
# docs/product/project-requirements-brief.md Appendix A cites case-box-plan.md.
dev-memo/superseded/

# ClauDepot writing workspace (2026-08-11). Active drafts and scratch may hold real client
# facts before anonymization, and posts/ + notes/ fall OUTSIDE the scan scope of
# apps/lawbar-desktop/scripts/check-no-real-data.mjs (SCOPE_HINTS covers case-box paths, the
# renderer, and test/contract fixtures — not new top-level dirs). This repo's history already
# carries one real-identifier leak that was never rewritten. Drafts stay out of git.
/posts/*
!/posts/.gitkeep
/notes/*
!/notes/.gitkeep
